      "side": 1,
      "message": "Using the script described the the markdown file displays any of the gpuinfo.org records that should be WebGPU-capable and don\u0027t have an associated entry in gpu_info.json. It gives you the device ID and the name from the driver, which is usually something like \"ARM Mali G710 \u003csome random numbers\u003e\" so then I go searching for \"Mali G710 GPU architecture\" and find a resource like this one from ARM that identifies is as their Valhall architecture:\n\nhttps://www.arm.com/products/silicon-ip-multimedia/gpu/mali-g710#:~:text\u003dof%20Silicon%20Success-,Valhall,The%20Valhall%20architecture%20is%20the%20basis%20of%20Mali%2DG710,-and%20future%20Mali\n\nIt\u0027s definitely not an exact science.",
